Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Optional: stops Chrome asking "Open Windows PowerShell?" on every site the first
; time an openinff: link is clicked there. Sets the AutoLaunchProtocolsFromOrigins
; policy so all sites may open openinff: without a prompt. This is safe only because
; openinff.ps1 ignores anything that isn't a YouTube link.
; Chrome will show "Managed by your organization" while any policy is set.
; Restart Chrome (or reload chrome://policy) after importing.
; To undo, delete the AutoLaunchProtocolsFromOrigins value below.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Google\Chrome]
"AutoLaunchProtocolsFromOrigins"="[{\"protocol\":\"openinff\",\"allowed_origins\":[\"*\"]}]"
